        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Max Martin, Shellback, Miley Cyrus\n- Songs and music videos: \"Wildest Dreams\", \"Dooo It!\"\n- Events: 2015 MTV Video Music Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift co-wrote the song \"Wildest Dreams\" with its producers Max Martin and Shellback.\n- On August 30, 2015, Miley Cyrus premiered \"Dooo It!\" with a live performance during the 2015 MTV Video Music Awards, which she hosted.\n- On August 30, 2015, Miley Cyrus made \"Dooo It!\" available free online without prior announcement alongside its parent album.\n- Taylor Swift's \"Wildest Dreams\" music video premiered during the pre-show of the 2015 MTV Video Music Awards.",
